--- !u!1001 &8826336608340621998
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3029950099273771978, guid: ae5ae7c3ff1008f4c936a40c9bbedd02, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Everything''s prepped. Fuel lines topped. Cryo calibrated. Autopilot
        synced for the long haul


        I still can''t believe this is happening.
        You, marked non grata for something we both know was a frame job. The Coalition
        made their mind up before your trial even began.


        So we vanish.
        Not running... Relocating. To Station Theta-7, far past Coalition reach.
        Where maybe you get to stop looking over your shoulder.


        I set the
        ship to wake us just before arrival. See you on the <color=red>other side</color>.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8495083335092659354, guid: ae5ae7c3ff1008f4c936a40c9bbedd02, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: note_1 Variant
